data: {"id": "5cfb05f050e54ecb-thinking-parallel_evidence-645", "run_id": "5cfb05f050e54ecb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集以下事实：\n\n**支持 Terminating 状态的事实：**\n1. Pod YAML 显示 `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`，且存在 `finalizers: aiops.lab/hold` —— 这是 Terminating 的直接原因，finalizer 阻止了 Pod 删除。\n2. `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0`，说明请求立即删除。\n3. 事件显示 `Normal Killing Pod/workload Stopping container app` —— Kubelet 已尝试停止容器。\n4. 容器状态 `exitCode=137`（SIGKILL），说明容器被强制终止，符合 Kubelet Killing 的行为。\n5. 拓扑确认 Pod 调度在 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.23`，UID `00030ff2-85db-453a-808d-4293aba8f20c`。\n\n**矛盾/补充事实：**\n1. Pod phase 仍为 `Running` 而非 `Termi", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788475379308, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

